s and use more items and packs against bots or other gamblers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837070/extras/fde191618c4fdaa633c81af30a21de22.avif?t=1771864107\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837070/extras_big/fde191618c4fdaa633c81af30a21de22.avif?t=1771864107 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kuiper Roulette and Coldspin by RYKG - Developed in Turbowarp</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtesters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coengine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VL_Cubic7274</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DailyNasrudin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Messyhair63</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jwnat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ThatOneMikkel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MtUnixic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NathanRog06</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wsauce</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microwave54</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is in early development and may have issues with bugs, please let me know on my discord if you have found an issue, or have any complaints.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["RYKG"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837070/74ce7bf06f9386764f93c34030c8c45810285380/header.jpg?t=1771864107","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Something that isn't over 5 years old should work well.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256MB<b